<template>
  <main class="content-page solar-page"><header class="solar-heading"><p class="section-kicker">SPACE / SOLAR ATLAS</p><h1>抬头之后，<br><span>还有八个世界。</span></h1><p>一个可以转动、靠近与停留的太阳系。原创建模，浅色图谱。</p></header>
    <div class="solar-toolbar"><button class="button button-primary" type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" :aria-pressed="playing" @click="toggle">{{ playing ? '暂停运行' : '播放示意轨道' }}</button><label>展示速度<select v-model.number="speed"><option :value=".25">0.25 ×</option><option :value="1">1 ×</option><option :value="4">4 ×</option></select></label><label><input v-model="labels" type="checkbox" /> 行星名称</label><button class="button button-secondary" type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" @click="scene?.reset()">回到全景</button></div>
    <section class="solar-layout"><div class="solar-stage" :data-playing="playing" :data-time="time.toFixed(2)"><div ref="mount" class="solar-canvas" /><p v-if="error" class="solar-error" role="status">{{ error }}</p><span class="solar-stage-note">拖动旋转 · 滚轮 / 双指缩放 · 点击行星</span></div><aside class="solar-information"><p class="section-kicker">{{ selected.english.toUpperCase() }} / 0{{ selected.order }}</p><div class="solar-planet-preview" :style="{ '--planet-color': selected.color }" :class="selected.id"><span /></div><h2>{{ selected.name }}</h2><p class="solar-type">{{ selected.type }} · 太阳向外第 {{ selected.order }} 颗</p><p>{{ selected.note }}</p><button class="text-button" type="button" :disabled="Boolean(error)" @click="closeUp">暂停并靠近它 ↗</button><a :href="NASA_SOURCE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NASA 原始资料 ↗</a><small>模型为艺术化示意，外观不是实拍；公转使用圆形轨道。大小、距离、速度均经独立压缩，不用于天体位置或日期预测。</small></aside></section>
    <nav class="solar-planet-list" aria-label="选择行星（无需操作 3D 场景）"><button v-for="planet in PLANETS" :key="planet.id" type="button" :aria-pressed="selected.id === planet.id" @click="select(planet.id)"><span :style="{ background: planet.color }" /><strong>{{ planet.name }}</strong><small>{{ planet.english }}</small></button></nav>
    <section class="solar-context"><h2>这是图谱，不是星历。</h2><p>八颗行星按距太阳的顺序排列。前四颗是类地行星；木星和土星为气态巨行星，天王星和海王星为冰巨行星。图谱不模拟卫星、偏心轨道、真实自转或当前天象。</p><p>尊重“减少动态效果”设置：初始静止，由你决定是否播放。切换标签页会停止动画，返回后需手动播放。触摸画布会操作相机，画布外仍可正常滚动页面。</p><p>交互灵感来自 <a href="https://solar-system-atlas.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Solar System Atlas</a>，本站未复制其代码、贴图或音效。知识核对：<a :href="NASA_SOURCE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NASA · About the Planets</a>（2026-10-05）。</p></section>
  </main>
</template>
<script setup>
import { computed, onMounted, onUnmounted, ref, watch } from 'vue'
import { useRoute, useRouter } from 'vue-router'
import { NASA_SOURCE, PLANETS } from '../features/solar-system/planets'
import { createSolarScene } from '../features/solar-system/scene'
const route = useRoute(), router = useRouter(), mount = ref(null), selectedId = ref(PLANETS.some(p => p.id === route.query.planet) ? route.query.planet : 'earth'), playing = ref(false), speed = ref(1), labels = ref(true), time = ref(0), error = ref('')
const selected = computed(() => PLANETS.find(p => p.id === selectedId.value) || PLANETS[2])
let scene, frame = 0, last = 0, seconds = 0, published = 0
function select(id) { if (!PLANETS.some(p => p.id === id)) return; selectedId.value = id; router.replace({ path: '/solar-system', query: { planet: id } }) }
watch(() => route.query.planet, id => { if (PLANETS.some(p => p.id === id)) selectedId.value = id })
watch(labels, show => scene?.labels(show))
function stop() { playing.value = false; cancelAnimationFrame(frame); last = 0; time.value = seconds }
function animate(now) { if (!playing.value) return; if (last) seconds += Math.min(.05, (now - last) / 1000) * speed.value; last = now; scene?.update(seconds); if (now - published > 100) { time.value = seconds; published = now } frame = requestAnimationFrame(animate) }
function toggle() { if (playing.value) stop(); else if (scene && !error.value) { playing.value = true; last = 0; frame = requestAnimationFrame(animate) } }
function closeUp() { stop(); scene?.focus(selectedId.value) }
function visibility() { if (document.hidden) stop() }
function contextLost(event) { event.preventDefault(); stop(); error.value = '图形上下文已丢失，请刷新页面恢复。行星文字图谱仍可阅读。' }
onMounted(() => { try { scene = createSolarScene(mount.value, select); scene.canvas.addEventListener('webglcontextlost', contextLost) } catch (cause) { error.value = cause.message || '3D 图谱暂时无法加载，仍可选择行星阅读资料。' } document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', visibility) })
onUnmounted(() => { stop(); document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange', visibility); scene?.canvas.removeEventListener('webglcontextlost', contextLost); scene?.dispose() })
</script>
<style scoped>
